WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:08.200
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.700
Start a new task

3
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:19.400
Type it in one line: what, when, #project, !priority

4
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.200
The date, project and priority are read as you type

5
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.900
Add Task

6
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.900
It went to the project you named…

7
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.400
…Home Renovation

8
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:40.000
Down to its tasks…

9
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:49.500
…and there it is, with its day, time and priority
